  "date_building_work_completed_under_previous_permission": null,
  "decision_conditions": [
    "Due to its scale, design and siting, the proposed development would disrupt the regularity of the short terrace group, which would in turn result in an incongruous addition which would have a negative impact on the appearance of the streetscape, and thus causes less than substantial harm to the character and appearance of the Conservation Area. There are no identified public benefits to outweigh this harm. For these reasons, the proposal does not accord with Policies LP1 or LP3 of the Local Plan, Policies 28 and 29 of the Publication Local Plan, nor does it accord with Section 72 (1) of the Planning (Listed Buildings and Conservation Areas) Act 1990. The proposal also fails to meet the aims of objectives of Policy HC1 (C) of the London Plan (2021) and the tests of paragraphs 212-215 of the NPPF (2024)."
  ],
